  "REQ GET https://storagetransfer.googleapis.com/v1/id1/%20x?alt=json&fields=kind%2Cid&filter=s-filter&pageSize=7&pageToken=s-nextpagetoken&prettyPrint=false&returnPartialSuccess=true",
